  "direction": "What does classifier-free guidance trade away? Train a small conditional diffusion model on a 2D conditional mixture (each class a multi-modal distribution) and sweep the guidance scale. Measure class-conditional precision (samples in the right class region), recall or mode coverage within each class, and variance collapse. Compare with unguided conditional sampling and with a low-temperature sampling baseline.",
